      color: {{typePrefix}}Tokens.background.resolve(context),
      border: Border.all(color: {{typePrefix}}Tokens.border.resolve(context)),
      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(5),
    ),
    child: Padding(
      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 7, vertical: 4),
